  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The sky is pure and azure, and the ground is like a sea of jade. The soil is especially fertile, with water plants growing lushly up to a man’s knee.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration calls this the famous Yu Tian of Northern Plains, reputed as one of the most abundant pasturelands, with people gathering under fluttering banners.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yu Tian’s heroes assembly has already lasted for half a month when Fang Yuan’s side arrives. In the first week every tribe shouts its own slogans; gradually the forces join into alliances until two strongest sides remain: Liu tribe’s Liu Wen Wu and Hei tribe’s Hei Lou Lan.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
